						 <p>This article is up for review. Please take the time to look it over, it needs more attention.</p> <hr /> <p>I actually like this one for its simplicity. It could use more, yeah, but unlike some others I've reviewed, I didn't feel like it actually <em>needed</em> more. It said what it wanted to say, with only a few words. I think the bits about language could've been implemented more elegantly, but other than that I like this one.</p> 
